{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-6","kind":"proposition","title":"等腰三角形逆定理：等角对等边","englishTitle":"If in a triangle two angles be equal to one another, the sides which subtend the equal angles will also be equal to one another.","book":1,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","contentId":"euclid-1-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8941ba3843d8514a334ff90f463a7058e06176a6a205f6130b3e641d6c60ad2c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-6.statement","euclid-1-6.construction.1","euclid-1-6.proof.1","euclid-1-6.proof.2","euclid-1-6.construction.2","euclid-1-6.construction.3","euclid-1-6.proof.3","euclid-1-6.proof.4","euclid-1-6.conclusion","euclid-1-6.historical.1","euclid-1-6.historical.2","euclid-1-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6746678f967e6402549fe0f8df7cce2088a0a341206c63fa875ea6f3111d99e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If in a triangle two angles be equal to one another, the sides which subtend the equal angles will also be equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果三角形中两个角度对等, 向下倾斜的两边也将对等。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形若底线两端之两角等，则两腰亦等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果三角形底边两端的角相等，那么与这两个角相对的两条边也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3396f34496de90e74d84984699e63c0ff4c675d772b6e0e9d9f7ddfa359016c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle having the angle ABC equal to the angle ACB;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC变成一个三角形,其角为ABC等于角为ACB;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0f03b961fd047b746a17ae4c2bae396bd87bf025cda2633e067c6e7eaa5ab37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the side AB is also equal to the side AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说AB线也和AC线一样"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a55839ee4c7fe930e49e6edd65fda921ceee2c79512055f9d3ed909461152f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if AB is unequal to AC, one of them is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果AB是不平等的,AC, 其中有一个更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"136e9e0d8f3357d425f19109b02ef68df39862f48b91ebbe975494f6ae4e086a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be greater; and from AB the greater let DB be cut off equal to AC the less;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB增加;从AB中,DB减少AC;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cfe862a0ab660f62acb5ed9de8df61951aa893e1059d323badcb5c22566fe05f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"let DC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让DC连接进来"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18891a5ee78ddf0372d2323b270d570a8e73dedc76a82537d22fa945e428703e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since DB is equal to AC, and BC is common, the two sides DB, BC are equal to the two sides AC, CB respectively; and the angle DBC is equal to the angle ACB; therefore the base DC is equal to the base AB, and the triangle DBC will be equal to the triangle ACB, the less to the greater: which is absurd. Therefore AB is not unequal to AC; it is therefore equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB等于AC,BC是常见的,双方DB,BC等于双方AC,CB;DBC角等于ACB角;因此,底边,DC等于底边,AB角,三角形DBC等于三角形ACB,数量小于较大数量:这是荒谬的。因此,AB不等于AC;因此,它等于AC角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"187ca8730ea3e8dde06c1336eea84cb99d096c8d0c1e5f488441c1c0481849a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形若底线两端之两角等，则两腰亦等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果三角形底边两端的角相等，那么与这两个角相对的两条边也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bac43b1732c5e317305c657fbcf31ad34b186511d390e5b49a43e8675584780","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云两腰线不等，而一长一短，试辩之。若甲乙为长线，即令比甲丙线截去所长之度，为乙丁线，而乙丁与甲丙等〈本篇三〉。次自丁至丙作直线，则本形成两三角形，其一为甲乙丙、其一为丁乙丙。而甲乙丙全形与丁乙丙分形同也，是全与其分等也〈公论九〉，何者？彼言丁乙丙分形之“乙丁”与甲乙丙全形之“甲丙”两线既等，丁乙丙分形之“乙丙”与甲乙丙全形之“乙丙”又同线，而元设丁乙丙与甲丙乙两角等，则丁乙丙与甲乙丙两形亦等也〈本篇四〉。是全与其分等也，故底线两端之两角等者，两腰必等也。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如云两腰线不等，而一长一短，试辩之。若甲乙为长线，即令比甲丙线截去所长之度，为乙丁线，而乙丁与甲丙等〈本篇三〉。次自丁至丙作直线，则本形成两三角形，其一为甲乙丙、其一为丁乙丙。而甲乙丙全形与丁乙丙分形同也，是全与其分等也〈公论九〉，何者？彼言丁乙丙分形之“乙丁”与甲乙丙全形之“甲丙”两线既等，丁乙丙分形之“乙丙”与甲乙丙全形之“乙丙”又同线，而元设丁乙丙与甲丙乙两角等，则丁乙丙与甲乙丙两形亦等也〈本篇四〉。是全与其分等也，故底线两端之两角等者，两腰必等也。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-6.source","contentId":"euclid-1-6","revisionId":"euclid-1-6@raw-8941ba3843d8514a","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"765c78e9f31c1e53043bf3f04d24f97cb0b0a5c7c3d8f789dbd7fcf9080829e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-4:euclid-1-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-4.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"I. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-9:euclid-1-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-9.proof.6","euclid-2-9.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-6